@startuml recommendation-service-추천조회
!theme mono

title 추천·이력 서비스 - 추천 조회 (UFR-REC-010, UFR-REC-030)

participant "RecommendationController" as Controller
participant "RecommendationService" as RecService
participant "CacheService" as CacheService
participant "ContextCollector" as ContextCollector
participant "RecommendationRepository" as RecRepo
participant "회원 서비스(E)" as MemberService
participant "날씨 API(E)" as WeatherAPI
participant "AI Pipeline(E)" as AIPipeline
database "추천·이력 DB" as RecDB
database "Redis Cache(E)" as Redis

Controller -> RecService: getTodayRecommendations(memberId, location)
activate RecService

== 캐시 확인 ==

RecService -> CacheService: getCachedRecommendation(memberId, location)
activate CacheService
CacheService -> Redis: 캐시 조회\n(rec:{memberId}:{locationGrid}:{weatherCode}:{weekday})
activate Redis
Redis --> CacheService: 캐시 결과 반환
deactivate Redis

alt 캐시 히트
    CacheService --> RecService: 캐시된 추천 결과 반환
    deactivate CacheService
    RecService --> Controller: RecommendationResult\n{추천 3개, cacheHit: true}
    note right : 응답 < 200ms

else 캐시 미스
    CacheService --> RecService: 캐시 없음
    deactivate CacheService

    == 컨텍스트 수집 ==

    RecService -> ContextCollector: collectContext(memberId, location)
    activate ContextCollector

    ContextCollector -> MemberService: GET /internal/members/{memberId}/taste-profile
    activate MemberService
    MemberService --> ContextCollector: 취향 벡터 + 알레르기 필터 반환
    deactivate MemberService

    ContextCollector -> WeatherAPI: GET /current?lat={lat}&lng={lng}
    activate WeatherAPI

    alt 날씨 API 정상
        WeatherAPI --> ContextCollector: 현재 날씨 반환\n{weatherCode, temperature}
        deactivate WeatherAPI
    else 날씨 API 장애 (Circuit Breaker)
        WeatherAPI --> ContextCollector: 오류
        deactivate WeatherAPI
        ContextCollector -> ContextCollector: 날씨 기본값 적용\n(맑음 처리)
    end

    ContextCollector -> RecRepo: 최근 7일 식사 이력 조회\n(memberId, 최근 3일 내 식당 목록)
    activate RecRepo
    RecRepo -> RecDB: SELECT 식사 이력 WHERE memberId AND 최근 7일
    RecDB --> RecRepo: 식사 이력 반환
    RecRepo --> ContextCollector: 최근 식사 이력 + 최근 3일 방문 식당 반환
    deactivate RecRepo

    ContextCollector -> ContextCollector: 콜드스타트 여부 확인\n(누적 피드백 5건 미만 체크)

    ContextCollector --> RecService: RecommendationContext\n{취향 벡터, 알레르기 필터, 날씨, 식사 이력, 콜드스타트 여부}
    deactivate ContextCollector

    == AI Pipeline 추천 요청 ==

    RecService -> AIPipeline: POST /internal/ai/recommend\n{RecommendationContext}
    activate AIPipeline

    alt LLM 정상 응답
        AIPipeline --> RecService: RecommendationResult\n{추천 3개, 추천 이유, 확신 스코어, 콜드스타트 태그}
        deactivate AIPipeline

        RecService -> CacheService: cacheRecommendation(cacheKey, result)
        activate CacheService
        CacheService -> Redis: 결과 캐싱\n(TTL: 당일 13:00까지)
        Redis --> CacheService: 저장 완료
        CacheService --> RecService: 캐싱 완료
        deactivate CacheService

        RecService -> RecRepo: 추천 이력 저장\n{memberId, 추천 3개, 생성 시각, 콘텍스트 요약}
        activate RecRepo
        RecRepo -> RecDB: INSERT 추천 이력
        RecDB --> RecRepo: 저장 완료
        RecRepo --> RecService: 완료
        deactivate RecRepo

        RecService --> Controller: RecommendationResult\n{추천 3개, 확신 스코어, cacheHit: false}
        note right : 응답 < 3초

    else LLM Circuit Breaker Open (폴백)
        AIPipeline --> RecService: FallbackRecommendation\n(규칙 기반: 반경 500m 인기 메뉴 + 알레르기 필터)
        deactivate AIPipeline

        RecService -> CacheService: cacheRecommendation(cacheKey, fallbackResult)
        activate CacheService
        CacheService -> Redis: 폴백 결과 캐싱
        Redis --> CacheService: 저장 완료
        CacheService --> RecService: 완료
        deactivate CacheService

        RecService --> Controller: FallbackRecommendationResult\n{폴백 추천 3개, fallback: true, "최신 추천을 불러오고 있어요"}
    end
end

deactivate RecService

@enduml
